{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UMIGARI</strong> is a first-person harpoon fishing game set in the foggy waters off the coast of Japan. Hunt fish with your harpoon, sell your catch, buy fuel, and upgrade your gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone at sea, the more you explore, the stranger the fish become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Localization: Other languages, aside from Japanese and English, are all machine-translated. Most localization will be fixed in the full version.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt with Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skillfully use your harpoon to catch a variety of fish, testing your timing and accuracy with every strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.poster.avif?t=1769057043\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.webm?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.mp4?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/a104d69e260a6ce49189698752696623.poster.avif?t=1769057043\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/a104d69e260a6ce49189698752696623.webm?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/a104d69e260a6ce49189698752696623.mp4?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship &amp; Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your catch for cash to enhance your ship\u2019s speed and fuel capacity, allowing you to venture deeper into uncharted waters and discover new islands and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/e613c828c35b942a869b09826454e9ac.poster.avif?t=1769057043\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/e613c828c35b942a869b09826454e9ac.webm?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/e613c828c35b942a869b09826454e9ac.mp4?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><br><br><strong>Explore the Open Sea\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through diverse ocean zones filled with rare fish, hidden finds, and powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/d3aff4300819af2d18074d5a139ce2a4.poster.avif?t=1769057043\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/d3aff4300819af2d18074d5a139ce2a4.webm?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/d3aff4300819af2d18074d5a139ce2a4.mp4?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><br><br><strong>Venture into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel deeper into the ocean where greater rewards await\u2014but only if you can make it back safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/1dc55b5fd20071321067b754a7648b79.poster.avif?t=1769057043\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/1dc55b5fd20071321067b754a7648b79.webm?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/1dc55b5fd20071321067b754a7648b79.mp4?t=1769057043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772960?t=1769057043","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772960?t=1769057043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/7a9dd2e5cf812ade1363324b898a9be49226f08e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769057043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/7a9dd2e5cf812ade1363324b898a9be49226f08e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769057043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoonish blood  \r\nViolence against fish"},"demos":[{"appid":3969060,